  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the instance creation menu, the fields designated for lines that explain the permissions of each type of instance, are currently too small.\n\nThis is problematic, as reducing the length of text by omitting information can lead to misunderstandings about how instance types function, potentially resulting in serious privacy and security issues.\n\nThe descriptions for permission types must be as clear as possible, necessitating larger text areas to include all the information that end users need to know.\n\nTherefore, please expand these user interface elements to be slightly wider and ensure they can accommodate at least two lines of text.",
